The app adapts the dark map style's labels, halos and overlay order. Forecast-derived current values may be interpolated between valid hourly samples; regional temperature-map values are interpolated between geographic samples. These transformations are estimates, not additional observations. Provider endpoints are queried directly and no data dump is bundled.

